> A calculation before fitting

Ten uniform CIFAR class logits assign each class probability.1 and loss log(10). The actual held-out confusion counts below are separate from this null likelihood reference.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/deit_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
